<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<subsection xml:id="late_policy" label="late_policy">
  <title>Late Policy</title>
  <p>
    Portfolio items and revisions that are not submitted by their deadlines will not be accepted, although a later presentation may still be submitted for your portfolio.
    Students who cannot submit work due to a University-related activity requiring an absence from class must arrange for work to be submitted <alert>before</alert> leaving.
  </p>
</subsection>
